      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Había una vez un hombre sabio y justo llamado Manu.",
          "en": "Once there was a wise and just man named Manu."
        },
        {
          "es": "Una mañana, le trajeron agua para lavarse las manos, como cada día.",
          "en": "One morning, they brought him water to wash his hands, as on every other day."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y en el agua del cuenco apareció un pececito.",
          "en": "And in the water of the bowl, a tiny fish appeared."
        },
        {
          "es": "El pez le habló: —Cuídame, y yo te salvaré.",
          "en": "The fish spoke to him: \"Take care of me, and I will save you.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "—¿Salvarme de qué? —preguntó Manu. —Va a venir una inundación que arrastrará a todos los seres.",
          "en": "\"Save me from what?\" asked Manu. \"A flood is coming that will sweep away every creature.\""
        }
      ],
