      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Manu llevó el pez al mar. Y antes de irse nadando, el pez le hizo una advertencia.",
          "en": "Manu carried the fish to the sea. And before swimming away, the fish gave him a warning."
        },
        {
          "es": "—En tal año llegará la inundación. Constrúyete un barco y espérame.",
          "en": "\"In such a year the flood will come. Build yourself a ship and wait for me.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Manu hizo exactamente eso. Construyó un barco fuerte y esperó.",
          "en": "Manu did exactly that. He built a strong ship and waited."
        },
        {
          "es": "Versiones posteriores, como la del Mahabharata, agregan que subió semillas de todas las plantas y a siete sabios.",
          "en": "Later versions, like the one in the Mahabharata, add that he took seeds of every plant and seven sages aboard."
        }
      ],
